{
    // The annex of the showcase: a second scene, which is where `cordite.scene.load` leads
    // from the first. scripts/travel.lua asks for it there when "travel" is pressed - T, or
    // Y on a gamepad - and the same script on an entity here asks for the way back.
    //
    // A scene is a file of its own, with entities of its own: nothing of the scene that
    // was left is here, and what its scripts knew is gone with it. What a scene does not
    // say - a sky, fog, how the picture is finished - is as the engine has it by itself.
    "format": "cordite.scene",
    "version": 1,
    "name": "Annex",
